                <p class="snippet" >
                    Citation: <b>D.B.S. v. S.R.G.</b>; L.J.W. v. T.A.R.; Henry v. Henry; Hiemstra v. Hiemstra, [2006] 2 S.C.R. 231, 2006 SCC 37 &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;In <b>D.B.S. v. S.R.G.</b>, the parents had three children in the course of their 10‐year common law relationship. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;6.1 <b>D.B.S. v. S.R.G.</b> 137 The D.B.S. appeal involves an original application for support. 
